        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "“I don’t want to be a doctor, and live by men’s diseases; nor a minister to live by their sins; nor a lawyer to live by their quarrels. So I don’t see there’s anything left for me but to be an author.”",
          "block_bbox": [
